                                "sense_id": "ddba70c1-7a8f-3375-9be8-e02ecec5ffe0",
                                "text": "When it was proposed that it should be revictualled on the same system as Belgium, Nicholas objected."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8f8f4fa-16ba-4e75-ba42-38a552649b83",
                                "sense_id": "ddba70c1-7a8f-3375-9be8-e02ecec5ffe0",
                                "text": "[…] stopping now and again to be revictualled through the window with pots of tea and proper meals […]"
